 current and original) - Corporation and Cooperative Applicant, notarized by any Notary Public\\n12. Valid I.D. of representatives, owners (Sole Proprietor, OPC, Partnership), and Corporate Secretary (Corporation, Cooperative) - 1 photocopy each) Applicant\\n13. Contract of Lease and copy of the Proof of ownership by the Lessor if business location is not owned and is rented by the applicant (1 photocopy) Applicant, notarized by any Notary Public\\n14. Any proof of ownership if Business location is owned Applicant\\n15. consent and copy of any proof of ownership if business location is not owned and is freely used by the applicant (1 photocopy) Applicant\\n16. OR/CR of vehicle, if with delivery vehicle (1 photocopy each vehicle) Applicant\\n17. Consent for use of the vehicle if not owned by the applicant. Applicant\\n18. FSIC for Occupancy Permit valid in the last 9 months Bureau of Fire Protection\\n19. Affidavit of Undertaking that there had been no substantial changes made on the building Applicant, notarized by any Notary Public\\n20. Other Requirements depending on the Business Activity declared Concerned Agency\\n\"\nRETRIEVED_CONTEXT_JSON_ONLY_EVIDENCE:\n\"Sketch / Google map of Business location (1 \\noriginal) with pictures of the premise location\\nApplicant\\n3.Certified List of Employees / Certification of \\nno Employee (1 original)\\nApplicant, notarized by any \\nNotary Public\\n4. Valid DTI Registration for Single \\nProprietorship (1 photocopy)\\nDepartment of Trade and Industry\\n5. SEC Registration, Articles of Incorporation \\nfor Partnership and Corporation (1 photocopy)\\nSecurities and Exchange \\nCommission\\n6. Certificate of Cooperation, Articles of \\nCooperation for Cooperative (1 photo\"\n\nJudge only the actual RETRIEVED_CONTEXT above. Does it state at least one fact requested by the actual QUESTION? Never assume that the reference facts occur in the passage. For verdict \"1\", quote the actual passage verbatim. For \"0\", evidence_quot